        desc = "INT_STAT_LINK0 is a link 0 interrupt status register.

Data sheet 9.3.6 INT_STAT_LINK0 (offset 0x1000, printed page 9-145, `hi3518ev200--Hi3518EV20X-Hi3516CV200-Datasheet.txt` line 57777).";

